    extra: ["Clive alone received over two lakh pounds, a scandalous fortune, and later faced an inquiry in Parliament.", "In Bengali the name Mir Jafar still means traitor.", "Within eight years the Company held the Diwani, the right to Bengal's taxes, and India's money began paying for India's conquest."],
